<concept id="t00090">
	<title id="e00647">Moving forward and backward</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00648">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00649">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV025006_2.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e00650"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>To move the seat forward or backward:</p>
		<ol>
			<li>
				<p>Push the control switch forward or rearward to move the seat to the desired position.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Release the switch once the seat reaches the desired position.</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
	</conbody>
</concept>